  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for Ed 505) #13101, eff 10-5-20; amd by #13167, INTERIM, eff 2-16-21, EXPIRED: 8-15-21 in (c) intro. and Table 505-1 criminal history record check clearance (5 year cycle) fee; ss by #13303, eff 12-10-21; ss by #13374, INTERIM, eff 4-26-22, EXPIRED: 10-23-22 New. #13562, eff 2-22-23; ss by #13961, EXRF, eff 5-10-24; ss by #14425, eff 11-14-25, EXPIRES: 11-14-35",
